{
  "info": {
    "name": "NestMart API",
    "description": "Complete NestMart backend API — Milestone 3.\n\n**Setup:**\n1. Run backend: `cd backend && npm run dev`\n2. Set `{{baseUrl}}` collection variable (default: http://localhost:5000)\n3. Run `Auth > Register` then `Auth > Verify OTP` (grab OTP from server logs), then `Auth > Login`\n4. Tokens from login are auto-saved to `{{accessToken}}` and `{{refreshToken}}`\n\nEvery request documents its expected response in its description.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:5000", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "accessToken", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "refreshToken", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "productId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "categoryId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "orderId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "addressId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "couponId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "reviewId", "value": "", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{accessToken}}", "type": "string" }]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /api/health",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/health",
            "description": "Liveness probe.\n\n**Response 200:**\n```json\n{\n  \"status\": \"ok\",\n  \"service\": \"nestmart-api\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-24T10:00:00.000Z\"\n}\n```"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /api/health/ready",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/health/ready",
            "description": "Readiness probe checking Mongo + Postgres.\n\n**Response 200 (ready) or 503 (degraded):**\n```json\n{ \"status\": \"ready\", \"checks\": { \"mongo\": true, \"postgres\": true } }\n```"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST /api/auth/register",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (body.user?.email) pm.collectionVariables.set('email', body.user.email);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Ankur Tester\",\n  \"email\": \"ankur+test@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Str0ngP@ssw0rd!\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "Creates a user, sends OTP email (6-digit, 10-min TTL) and welcome email.\n\n**201:**\n```json\n{\n  \"user\": { \"id\": \"clxxx\", \"email\": \"...\", \"name\": \"...\", \"role\": \"customer\", \"emailVerified\": false },\n  \"otpSent\": true\n}\n```\n\n**409** if email already registered."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /api/auth/verify-otp",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/verify-otp",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"ankur+test@example.com\",\n  \"otp\": \"123456\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "Verifies the 6-digit OTP. OTP is emitted via SMTP when configured; in dev it's logged by the server.\n\n**200:** `{ \"verified\": true }`\n**400:** `Invalid or expired code`"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /api/auth/login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (body.accessToken) pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', body.accessToken);",
                  "if (body.refreshToken) pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', body.refreshToken);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"ankur+test@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Str0ngP@ssw0rd!\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "**200:**\n```json\n{\n  \"user\": { \"id\": \"...\", \"email\": \"...\", \"role\": \"customer\" },\n  \"accessToken\": \"<jwt 15m>\",\n  \"refreshToken\": \"<jwt 7d>\"\n}\n```\n**401** on bad credentials."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /api/auth/refresh",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (body.accessToken) pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', body.accessToken);",
                  "if (body.refreshToken) pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', body.refreshToken);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/refresh",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{ \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\" }"
            },
            "description": "Rotates refresh token. Old session is revoked; new pair is issued.\n\n**200:** same shape as login."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /api/auth/logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{ \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\" }"
            },
            "description": "Revokes the refresh token's session row. Idempotent.\n\n**200:** `{ \"ok\": true }`"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /api/auth/forgot-password",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/forgot-password",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{ \"email\": \"ankur+test@example.com\" }"
            },
            "description": "Always returns 200 regardless of whether the email exists (prevents user enumeration).\n\nIf the email exists, a signed reset link is emailed (30-min TTL)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /api/auth/reset-password",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/reset-password",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"token\": \"<token from email link>\",\n  \"password\": \"NewStr0ngP@ss!\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "Validates the token, updates password hash, revokes ALL active sessions for that user.\n\n**200:** `{ \"ok\": true }`\n**400:** on invalid/expired token."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Products",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /api/products",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/products?q=&category=&brand=&tag=&minPrice=&maxPrice=&minRating=&inStock=&sort=newest&page=1&limit=20",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "products"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "q", "value": "", "description": "text search across title/description/tags" },
                { "key": "category", "value": "", "description": "Category ObjectId" },
                { "key": "brand", "value": "" },
                { "key": "tag", "value": "" },
                { "key": "minPrice", "value": "" },
                { "key": "maxPrice", "value": "" },
                { "key": "minRating", "value": "", "description": "0..5" },
                { "key": "inStock", "value": "", "description": "true|false" },
                { "key": "sort", "value": "newest", "description": "newest|price-asc|price-desc|rating|popular" },
                { "key": "page", "value": "1" },
                { "key": "limit", "value": "20" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "**200:**\n```json\n{\n  \"items\": [ { \"_id\": \"...\", \"slug\": \"aurora-sofa\", \"title\": \"...\", \"price\": 799, \"stock\": 11, \"ratingAverage\": 4.7 } ],\n  \"pagination\": { \"page\": 1, \"limit\": 20, \"total\": 42, \"totalPages\": 3 }\n}\n```"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /api/products/:id",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{productId}}",
            "description": "**200:** full product document. **404** if not found or invalid ObjectId."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /api/products/:id/related",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{productId}}/related",
            "description": "Returns up to 8 products matching by category or tag overlap, sorted by rating.\n\n**200:** `{ \"items\": [...] }`"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /api/products (admin)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (body._id) pm.collectionVariables.set('productId', body._id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/products",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"slug\": \"aurora-sofa\",\n  \"title\": \"Aurora Linen Sofa\",\n  \"description\": \"Three-seater linen sofa\",\n  \"brand\": \"NestMart\",\n  \"category\": \"{{categoryId}}\",\n  \"tags\": [\"living-room\", \"sofa\"],\n  \"images\": [\"https://cdn.example.com/aurora.jpg\"],\n  \"price\": 799,\n  \"compareAtPrice\": 899,\n  \"stock\": 11,\n  \"isActive\": true,\n  \"isFeatured\": true\n}"
            },
            "description": "Requires admin or manager. **201:** returns created product."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "PATCH /api/products/:id (admin)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{productId}}",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{ \"price\": 749, \"stock\": 20 }"
            },
            "description": "Requires admin or manager. **200:** returns updated product."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "DELETE /api/products/:id (admin)",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{productId}}",
            "description": "Requires admin. **200:** `{ \"ok\": true }`"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
